Fund will send you a Form 1099 DIV for the calendar year that will tell you how to report these distributions for federal income tax purposes."]},{"type":"p","children":["Return figures provided below are based on the change in the Fund's Net Asset Value per share (\"NAV\"), compared to the annualized distribution rate for this current distribution as a percentage of the NAV on the last day of the month prior to distribution record date."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Annualized"]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Fund"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["5-Year"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Fiscal YTD"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Fiscal YTD"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Fiscal YTD"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["NAV Return"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children